  "query": "A rally car starts at point P and races to point Q. Here the car turns west and races to point R. At point R the car must turn to head directly back to point P.\n\nWhat is the compass bearing of R from P? Give your answer to one decimal place.",
  "answer": "\\[S 23.5 ^\\circ W\\]",
