    "previous_model_response": "The displacement from \\(P\\) to \\(R\\) is \\(83\\) km west and \\(191\\) km south.\n\nThe angle south of west is\n\n\\[\n\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{191}{83}\\right)\\approx 66.5^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nWest has a bearing of \\(270^\\circ\\), so the bearing of \\(R\\) from \\(P\\) is\n\n\\[\n270^\\circ+66.5^\\circ=\\boxed{336.5^\\circ}.\n\\]"
  },
